# player-pose-corpus.manifest - (level, player pose) tuples for a Spyro 3
# corpus captured under pad control with the follow camera, the counterpart
# of freecam-corpus.manifest for scenes the freecam cannot reach (a placement
# triggers the cutscene or the actor the row demonstrates).
#   <level> | pos=(x, y, z)[,yaw] | [start]
#   level  a --skip-to-level name
#   pose   a --player-pose string, pasted verbatim
#   start  optional pinned canonical frame
# No script consumes this file yet; the capture leg that reads it is owed.
# Each row carries a comment naming what it demonstrates.
# Isabelle's dragon-egg rescue cutscene: placing the player here triggers it
sunrise_spring | pos=(28179, 32803, 17766)
